<title>CHILE: Banco Edwards confirms Favre as CEO.</title>
<headline>Banco Edwards confirms Favre as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Banco de A. Edwards said acting general manager Gustavo Favre has been appointed chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Favre, appointed as acting CEO two months ago, replaces Julio Jaraquemada who resigned after the bank faced difficulties with loans made to a number of customers.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212</p>
